      "body": "WSFx Global Pay Limited has appointed Mr. Gaurang Vora as the Senior Vice President & Head – Technology of the Company with effect from January 5, 2026. Mr. Vora is a seasoned technology and delivery leader with over 20 years of cross-industry experience across FinTech, EdTech, Healthcare, and Retail, specializing in digital transformation, platform scaling, and enterprise modernization. He has previously held leadership positions at SBI Life Insurance Ltd, Spice Money, LRN Technologies, Ananta Technologies, and Dimension Data, where he spearheaded large-scale programs in AePS, DMT, BBPS, PPI-UPI, CMS, and Virtualization domains. Notably, he has been recognized as next 100 CIO and is also among the Top 15 Global PMO Influencers and is an award-winning program management professional, with ",
